# Learning/process evidence
#
# Intentionally DO NOT ignore `.local-agents/` in Kencleng.
# This repository is a learning-by-doing project and representative
# Harscode/agent process artifacts are committed so other readers can
# inspect how work was explored, planned, built, reviewed, and tested.
# Old generations may be removed from the active tree during a reboot;
# Git history remains their archive.
